[
  {
    "doc": "d1",
    "kind": "code",
    "needle": "CPU 中的寄存器",
    "html": "<figure class=\"d12-figure\" aria-labelledby=\"d12-memory-title\">\n<div class=\"d12-heading\" id=\"d12-memory-title\">地址指向字节，指令决定读多宽</div>\n<div class=\"d12-memory-flow\">\n<section class=\"d12-panel\" aria-label=\"CPU寄存器\"><div class=\"d12-eyebrow\">CPU 中的寄存器</div><div class=\"d12-register\"><code>%rdi</code><strong>0x1000</strong><span>保存地址</span></div><div class=\"d12-register\"><code>%eax</code><strong>?</strong><span>等待读入</span></div></section>\n<div class=\"d12-connector\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>用作地址</span><b>→</b></div>\n<section class=\"d12-panel d12-memory\" aria-label=\"小端内存，地址0x1000开始的四个字节\"><div class=\"d12-eyebrow\">内存 · 每行 1 字节</div><div class=\"d12-memory-head\"><span>地址</span><span>内容（十六进制）</span></div><div class=\"d12-memory-row\"><code>0x1000</code><strong>05</strong></div><div class=\"d12-memory-row\"><code>0x1001</code><strong>00</strong></div><div class=\"d12-memory-row\"><code>0x1002</code><strong>00</strong></div><div class=\"d12-memory-row\"><code>0x1003</code><strong>00</strong></div></section>\n</div><div class=\"d12-instruction\"><code>movl (%rdi), %eax</code><span>从 0x1000 起，读连续 4 字节</span></div>\n<div class=\"d12-result\"><span>小端还原：<code>0x00000005</code></span><strong>%eax = 5</strong></div>\n<figcaption class=\"d12-caption\">执行后，%rdi 仍为 0x1000，四个内存字节也没有改变。地址是位置，5 是从这个位置读出的整数。</figcaption></figure>"
  },
  {
    "doc": "d1",
    "kind": "code",
    "needle": "只留下两边都有的 1",
    "html": "<figure class=\"d12-figure\" aria-labelledby=\"d12-bitops-title\"><div class=\"d12-heading\" id=\"d12-bitops-title\">按列看：每次只处理对应的两个位</div><div class=\"d12-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"六行8位运算，可横向滚动\"><div class=\"d12-bitops\"><div class=\"d12-bit-row\"><code>a</code><div class=\"d12-bit-strip\" aria-label=\"00111100\"><span class=\"d12-bit d12-off\">0</span><span class=\"d12-bit d12-off\">0</span><span class=\"d12-bit d12-on\">1</span><span class=\"d12-bit d12-on\">1</span><span class=\"d12-bit d12-on\">1</span><span class=\"d12-bit d12-on\">1</span><span class=\"d12-bit d12-off\">0</span><span class=\"d12-bit d12-off\">0</span></div><span class=\"d12-row-note\">输入</span></div><div class=\"d12-bit-row\"><code>b</code><div class=\"d12-bit-strip\" aria-label=\"00001111\"><span class=\"d12-bit d12-off\">0</span><span class=\"d12-bit d12-off\">0</span><span class=\"d12-bit d12-off\">0</span><span class=\"d12-bit d12-off\">0</span><span class=\"d12-bit d12-on\">1</span><span class=\"d12-bit d12-on\">1</span><span class=\"d12-bit d12-on\">1</span><span class=\"d12-bit d12-on\">1</span></div><span class=\"d12-row-note\">输入</span></div><div class=\"d12-bit-row\"><code>a &amp; b</code><div class=\"d12-bit-strip\" aria-label=\"00001100\"><span class=\"d12-bit d12-off\">0</span><span class=\"d12-bit d12-off\">0</span><span class=\"d12-bit d12-off\">0</span><span class=\"d12-bit d12-off\">0</span><span class=\"d12-bit d12-on\">1</span><span class=\"d12-bit d12-on\">1</span><span class=\"d12-bit d12-off\">0</span><span class=\"d12-bit d12-off\">0</span></div><span class=\"d12-row-note\">两边都是 1</span></div><div class=\"d12-bit-row\"><code>a | b</code><div class=\"d12-bit-strip\" aria-label=\"00111111\"><span class=\"d12-bit d12-off\">0</span><span class=\"d12-bit d12-off\">0</span><span class=\"d12-bit d12-on\">1</span><span class=\"d12-bit d12-on\">1</span><span class=\"d12-bit d12-on\">1</span><span class=\"d12-bit d12-on\">1</span><span class=\"d12-bit d12-on\">1</span><span class=\"d12-bit d12-on\">1</span></div><span class=\"d12-row-note\">至少一边是 1</span></div><div class=\"d12-bit-row\"><code>a ^ b</code><div class=\"d12-bit-strip\" aria-label=\"00110011\"><span class=\"d12-bit d12-off\">0</span><span class=\"d12-bit d12-off\">0</span><span class=\"d12-bit d12-on\">1</span><span class=\"d12-bit d12-on\">1</span><span class=\"d12-bit d12-off\">0</span><span class=\"d12-bit d12-off\">0</span><span class=\"d12-bit d12-on\">1</span><span class=\"d12-bit d12-on\">1</span></div><span class=\"d12-row-note\">两边不同</span></div><div class=\"d12-bit-row\"><code>~a</code><div class=\"d12-bit-strip\" aria-label=\"11000011\"><span class=\"d12-bit d12-on\">1</span><span class=\"d12-bit d12-on\">1</span><span class=\"d12-bit d12-off\">0</span><span class=\"d12-bit d12-off\">0</span><span class=\"d12-bit d12-off\">0</span><span class=\"d12-bit d12-off\">0</span><span class=\"d12-bit d12-on\">1</span><span class=\"d12-bit d12-on\">1</span></div><span class=\"d12-row-note\">只展示 8 位取反</span></div></div></div><figcaption class=\"d12-caption\">位串从左到右是第 7 位到第 0 位。这里是 8 位模式示意；真实 C 的 ~a 还要先检查整数提升。</figcaption></figure>"
  },
  {
    "doc": "d1",
    "kind": "table",
    "needle": "无符号权重",
    "html": "<figure class=\"d12-figure\" data-bit-demo data-initial-bits=\"11011011\" aria-labelledby=\"d12-twos-title\"><div class=\"d12-heading\" id=\"d12-twos-title\">点击一个位，比较两种解释</div><p class=\"d12-description\">8 位模式保持一致；只有最高位的权重由 +128 变成 −128。</p><div class=\"d12-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"8位权重图，可横向滚动\"><div class=\"d12-weights\"><div class=\"d12-weight-row\"><span class=\"d12-row-label\">位位置</span><div class=\"d12-eight\"><span>7</span><span>6</span><span>5</span><span>4</span><span>3</span><span>2</span><span>1</span><span>0</span></div></div><div class=\"d12-weight-row\"><span class=\"d12-row-label\">位值 · 可点击</span><div class=\"d12-eight\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"d12-toggle-bit d12-sign-bit\" data-bit-index=\"7\" data-bit-value=\"1\" aria-pressed=\"true\" aria-label=\"第7位，当前为1，点击翻转\">1</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"d12-toggle-bit\" data-bit-index=\"6\" data-bit-value=\"1\" aria-pressed=\"true\" aria-label=\"第6位，当前为1，点击翻转\">1</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"d12-toggle-bit\" data-bit-index=\"5\" data-bit-value=\"0\" aria-pressed=\"false\" aria-label=\"第5位，当前为0，点击翻转\">0</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"d12-toggle-bit\" data-bit-index=\"4\" data-bit-value=\"1\" aria-pressed=\"true\" aria-label=\"第4位，当前为1，点击翻转\">1</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"d12-toggle-bit\" data-bit-index=\"3\" data-bit-value=\"1\" aria-pressed=\"true\" aria-label=\"第3位，当前为1，点击翻转\">1</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"d12-toggle-bit\" data-bit-index=\"2\" data-bit-value=\"0\" aria-pressed=\"false\" aria-label=\"第2位，当前为0，点击翻转\">0</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"d12-toggle-bit\" data-bit-index=\"1\" data-bit-value=\"1\" aria-pressed=\"true\" aria-label=\"第1位，当前为1，点击翻转\">1</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"d12-toggle-bit\" data-bit-index=\"0\" data-bit-value=\"1\" aria-pressed=\"true\" aria-label=\"第0位，当前为1，点击翻转\">1</button></div></div><div class=\"d12-weight-row\"><span class=\"d12-row-label\">无符号权重</span><div class=\"d12-eight\"><span>128</span><span>64</span><span>32</span><span>16</span><span>8</span><span>4</span><span>2</span><span>1</span></div></div><div class=\"d12-weight-row\"><span class=\"d12-row-label\">补码权重</span><div class=\"d12-eight\"><span class=\"d12-negative\">−128</span><span>64</span><span>32</span><span>16</span><span>8</span><span>4</span><span>2</span><span>1</span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"d12-dual-results\"><div><span>无符号解释</span><output data-unsigned aria-live=\"polite\">219</output></div><div><span>8 位补码解释</span><output data-signed aria-live=\"polite\">−37</output></div></div><div class=\"d12-equation\"><span>补码加权</span><output data-bit-formula aria-live=\"polite\">−128 + 64 + 16 + 8 + 2 + 1 = −37</output></div><div class=\"d12-control-row\"><span class=\"d12-description\">试试只翻转第 7 位，观察符号位的贡献。</span><button class=\"d12-small-button\" type=\"button\" data-reset-bits>恢复 11011011</button></div><figcaption class=\"d12-caption\">原始模式为 1101 1011：无符号为 219，补码为 −37。最高位为 1 时，补码值等于无符号值减 256。</figcaption></figure>"
  },
  {
    "doc": "d1",
    "kind": "table",
    "needle": "小端，每格一个字节",
    "html": "<figure class=\"d12-figure\" aria-labelledby=\"d12-endian-title\"><div class=\"d12-heading\" id=\"d12-endian-title\">同一个数，字节落在不同地址</div><div class=\"d12-value-label\">32 位数 <strong>0x1234ABCD</strong><span>12 是最高有效字节；CD 是最低有效字节。</span></div><div class=\"d12-endian-group\"><div class=\"d12-row-title\"><strong>小端 · x86-64</strong><span>低地址 → 高地址</span></div><div class=\"d12-bytes\"><div class=\"d12-byte d12-blue\"><span class=\"d12-address\">0x2000</span><strong>CD</strong></div><div class=\"d12-byte \"><span class=\"d12-address\">0x2001</span><strong>AB</strong></div><div class=\"d12-byte \"><span class=\"d12-address\">0x2002</span><strong>34</strong></div><div class=\"d12-byte d12-purple\"><span class=\"d12-address\">0x2003</span><strong>12</strong></div></div><p class=\"d12-description\">最低有效字节 CD 放在最低地址 0x2000。</p></div><div class=\"d12-endian-group\"><div class=\"d12-row-title\"><strong>大端</strong><span>低地址 → 高地址</span></div><div class=\"d12-bytes\"><div class=\"d12-byte d12-purple\"><span class=\"d12-address\">0x2000</span><strong>12</strong></div><div class=\"d12-byte \"><span class=\"d12-address\">0x2001</span><strong>34</strong></div><div class=\"d12-byte \"><span class=\"d12-address\">0x2002</span><strong>AB</strong></div><div class=\"d12-byte d12-blue\"><span class=\"d12-address\">0x2003</span><strong>CD</strong></div></div><p class=\"d12-description\">最高有效字节 12 放在最低地址 0x2000。</p></div><figcaption class=\"d12-caption\">每格恰好 1 字节。两种排列还原的整数都为 0x1234ABCD；字节内部的位没有反转。</figcaption></figure>"
  },
  {
    "doc": "d1",
    "kind": "code",
    "needle": "位号 63",
    "html": "<figure class=\"d12-figure\" aria-labelledby=\"d12-subreg-title\"><div class=\"d12-heading\" id=\"d12-subreg-title\">同一只 rax，按不同宽度访问</div><div class=\"d12-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"子寄存器范围图，可横向滚动\"><div class=\"d12-register-map\"><div class=\"d12-register-scale\"><span>位号</span><div class=\"d12-eight\"><span>63—56</span><span>55—48</span><span>47—40</span><span>39—32</span><span>31—24</span><span>23—16</span><span>15—8</span><span>7—0</span></div></div><div class=\"d12-register-slice\"><code>%rax</code><div class=\"d12-register-track\"><div class=\"d12-register-fill d12-col-1 d12-span-8\"><strong>全部 64 位</strong></div></div></div><div class=\"d12-register-slice\"><code>%eax</code><div class=\"d12-register-track\"><div class=\"d12-register-fill d12-col-5 d12-span-4\"><strong>位 31—0</strong></div></div></div><div class=\"d12-register-slice\"><code>%ax</code><div class=\"d12-register-track\"><div class=\"d12-register-fill d12-col-7 d12-span-2\"><strong>位 15—0</strong></div></div></div><div class=\"d12-register-slice\"><code>%ah</code><div class=\"d12-register-track\"><div class=\"d12-register-fill d12-col-7 d12-span-1\"><strong>15—8</strong></div></div></div><div class=\"d12-register-slice\"><code>%al</code><div class=\"d12-register-track\"><div class=\"d12-register-fill d12-col-8 d12-span-1\"><strong>7—0</strong></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"d12-note-pair\"><span><strong>写 eax：</strong>高 32 位自动清零。</span><span><strong>写 ax / al：</strong>保留其余位。</span></div><figcaption class=\"d12-caption\">每一小格对应 8 位。所有低位视图都靠右对齐；ah 独占第 8—15 位，和 al 相邻。读 eax 不会清高位，写 eax 才会。</figcaption></figure>"
  },
  {
    "doc": "d2",
    "kind": "code",
    "needle": "exp：k 位",
    "html": "<figure class=\"d12-figure\" data-stepper aria-labelledby=\"d12-float-title\"><div class=\"d12-heading\" id=\"d12-float-title\">从字段到数值：先分类，再解释</div><div class=\"d12-stepper-stage\">\n<section class=\"diagram-step d12-step\" data-step=\"0\"><p class=\"d12-step-title\">1 · 先读位串，不能直接代入数值公式</p><div class=\"d12-field-strip\"><div class=\"d12-field d12-purple\"><strong>s</strong><span>1 位符号</span></div><div class=\"d12-field d12-blue\"><strong>exp</strong><span>k 位 → 无符号整数 e</span></div><div class=\"d12-field\"><strong>frac</strong><span>n 位 → 无符号整数 F</span></div></div><div class=\"d12-direction\"><span>最高位在左</span><span>最低位在右</span></div><div class=\"d12-rule-list\"><div><code>exp 非全 0、非全 1</code><strong>规格化</strong></div><div><code>exp 全 0</code><strong>非规格化或零</strong></div><div><code>exp 全 1</code><strong>无穷或 NaN</strong></div></div><p class=\"d12-description\">exp 与 frac 是存储字段；E 与 M 是按类别解释出的指数和有效数。</p></section>\n<section class=\"diagram-step d12-step\" data-step=\"1\" hidden><p class=\"d12-step-title\">2 · 规格化：恢复隐藏的前导 1</p><div class=\"d12-condition\">条件：1 ≤ e ≤ 2<sup>k</sup> − 2</div><div class=\"d12-formula-pair\"><div><span>阶码字段 → 真实指数</span><strong>E = e − Bias</strong><p>Bias = 2<sup>k−1</sup> − 1<br>exp 用偏置编码，不是补码。</p></div><div><span>小数字段 → 有效数</span><strong>M = 1 + F / 2<sup>n</sup></strong><p>前导 1 不占 frac 存储位。<br>M = 1.frac₂</p></div></div><div class=\"d12-formula-result\">V = (−1)<sup>s</sup> × M × 2<sup>E</sup></div></section>\n<section class=\"diagram-step d12-step\" data-step=\"2\" hidden><p class=\"d12-step-title\">3 · 非规格化：固定指数，取消隐藏的 1</p><div class=\"d12-condition\">条件：e = 0，F ≠ 0</div><div class=\"d12-formula-pair\"><div><span>真实指数</span><strong>E = 1 − Bias</strong><p>与最小规格化指数相同，<br>让零附近的刻度平滑衔接。</p></div><div><span>有效数</span><strong>M = F / 2<sup>n</sup></strong><p>这里是 0.frac₂，<br>不能补上规格化的前导 1。</p></div></div><div class=\"d12-special-row\"><span><strong>e=0，F=0</strong> → ±0</span><span><strong>exp 全 1，F=0</strong> → ±∞</span><span><strong>exp 全 1，F≠0</strong> → NaN</span></div></section>\n</div><div class=\"d12-step-controls\"><button class=\"d12-small-button\" type=\"button\" data-prev aria-label=\"上一步浮点字段解释\" disabled>上一步</button><output data-step-label aria-live=\"polite\">1 / 3</output><button class=\"d12-small-button\" type=\"button\" data-next aria-label=\"下一步浮点字段解释\">下一步</button></div><figcaption class=\"d12-caption\">符号位最后决定正负。先确认 exp 的类别，才能选择正确的 E 与 M；无穷和 NaN 不套有限数公式。</figcaption></figure>"
  },
  {
    "doc": "d2",
    "kind": "code",
    "needle": "0   1/32   2/32   3/32",
    "html": "<figure class=\"d12-figure\" aria-labelledby=\"d12-spacing-title\"><div class=\"d12-heading\" id=\"d12-spacing-title\">刻度在变，数轴上的距离有意义</div><div class=\"d12-description\">7 位格式：s / exp / frac = 1 / 3 / 3，Bias = 3。只画非负部分。</div><div class=\"d12-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"浮点数轴，可横向滚动\"><svg class=\"d12-numberline\" viewBox=\"0 0 756 250\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"d12-line-title d12-line-desc\"><title id=\"d12-line-title\">七位浮点格式在零附近的数轴</title><desc id=\"d12-line-desc\">k为3，n为3，Bias为3。非规格化最小步长为1/32，最小规格化数8/32等于1/4，之后初始规格化区间的步长仍为1/32。到16/32等于1/2后，步长变为1/16，下一刻度为18/32。</desc><line x1=\"36\" y1=\"105\" x2=\"723\" y2=\"105\" class=\"d12-svg-axis\"/><path d=\"M717 100 L724 105 L717 110\" class=\"d12-svg-axis\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M80 52 V45 H296 V52\" class=\"d12-svg-bracket\"/><text x=\"188\" y=\"31\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"d12-svg-label\">非规格化 · 间距 1/32</text><path d=\"M332 78 V71 H584 V78\" class=\"d12-svg-bracket\"/><text x=\"458\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"d12-svg-label\">E = −2 · 间距 1/32</text><path d=\"M620 172 V181 H692 V172\" class=\"d12-svg-bracket\"/><text x=\"656\" y=\"206\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"d12-svg-label\">间距 1/16</text><circle cx=\"44\" cy=\"105\" r=\"5\" class=\"d12-svg-neutral\"/><text x=\"44\" y=\"135\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"d12-svg-tick\">0</text><circle cx=\"80\" cy=\"105\" r=\"5\" class=\"d12-svg-purple\"/><text x=\"80\" y=\"135\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"d12-svg-tick\">1/32</text><circle cx=\"116\" cy=\"105\" r=\"5\" class=\"d12-svg-purple\"/><text x=\"116\" y=\"135\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"d12-svg-tick\">2/32</text><circle cx=\"152\" cy=\"105\" r=\"5\" class=\"d12-svg-purple\"/><text x=\"152\" y=\"135\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"d12-svg-tick\">3/32</text><circle cx=\"296\" cy=\"105\" r=\"5\" class=\"d12-svg-purple\"/><text x=\"296\" y=\"135\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"d12-svg-tick\">7/32</text><circle cx=\"332\" cy=\"105\" r=\"5\" class=\"d12-svg-blue\"/><text x=\"332\" y=\"135\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"d12-svg-tick\">8/32</text><circle cx=\"368\" cy=\"105\" r=\"5\" class=\"d12-svg-blue\"/><text x=\"368\" y=\"135\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"d12-svg-tick\">9/32</text><circle cx=\"584\" cy=\"105\" r=\"5\" class=\"d12-svg-blue\"/><text x=\"584\" y=\"135\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"d12-svg-tick\">15/32</text><circle cx=\"620\" cy=\"105\" r=\"5\" class=\"d12-svg-blue\"/><text x=\"620\" y=\"135\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"d12-svg-tick\">16/32</text><circle cx=\"692\" cy=\"105\" r=\"5\" class=\"d12-svg-blue\"/><text x=\"692\" y=\"135\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"d12-svg-tick\">18/32</text><text x=\"332\" y=\"161\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"d12-svg-label\">1/4</text><text x=\"332\" y=\"188\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"d12-svg-muted\">最小规格化数</text><text x=\"620\" y=\"161\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"d12-svg-label\">1/2</text><text x=\"224\" y=\"96\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"d12-svg-muted\">···</text><text x=\"476\" y=\"96\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"d12-svg-muted\">···</text></svg></div><div class=\"d12-note-pair\"><span><strong>跨过 1/4：</strong>间距仍是 1/32。</span><span><strong>到达 1/2：</strong>往右的间距加倍为 1/16。</span></div><figcaption class=\"d12-caption\">非规格化与规格化在 1/4 处平滑连接；右侧刻度变稀表示绝对精度变粗。省略号表示未逐一标出的中间刻度。</figcaption></figure>"
  },
  {
    "doc": "d2",
    "kind": "code",
    "needle": "按目标精度舍入 ──",
    "html": "<figure class=\"d12-figure\" aria-labelledby=\"d12-round-title\"><div class=\"d12-heading\" id=\"d12-round-title\">舍入完成后，还要看一眼指数</div><div class=\"d12-round-top\"><div class=\"d12-flow-card\"><span>起点</span><strong>精确二进制结果</strong></div><span class=\"d12-flow-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span><div class=\"d12-flow-card d12-blue\"><span>按目标精度</span><strong>最近偶数舍入</strong></div></div><div class=\"d12-branches\"><section class=\"d12-panel\"><div class=\"d12-eyebrow\">没有改变数量级</div><div class=\"d12-path-line\"><strong>保留当前 E、M</strong><span aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</span><strong>写入字段</strong></div></section><section class=\"d12-panel\"><div class=\"d12-eyebrow\">进位形成 10.000…</div><div class=\"d12-path-line\"><code>1.111… → 10.000…</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</span><strong>右移一位，E 加 1</strong><span aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</span><strong>再检查 E 是否超出范围</strong></div></section></div><figcaption class=\"d12-caption\">进位可能改变数量级。把 10.000… 改回 1.000… 时，必须同步增加指数，不能只改 frac。</figcaption></figure>"
  },
  {
    "doc": "d2",
    "kind": "code",
    "needle": "cmp b,a：概念上求 a-b，但不改 a",
    "html": "<figure class=\"d12-figure\" aria-labelledby=\"d12-flags-title\"><div class=\"d12-heading\" id=\"d12-flags-title\">同一组标志，可以控制三件不同的事</div><div class=\"d12-compare\"><code>cmp b, a</code><span>概念上计算 <strong>a − b</strong>；不把差写回 a。</span></div><div class=\"d12-down-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"d12-flags\"><div class=\"d12-flag\"><strong>CF</strong><span>进位 / 借位</span></div><div class=\"d12-flag\"><strong>ZF</strong><span>结果为零</span></div><div class=\"d12-flag\"><strong>SF</strong><span>结果符号位</span></div><div class=\"d12-flag\"><strong>OF</strong><span>补码溢出</span></div></div><div class=\"d12-down-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓ 查看相应条件组合</div><div class=\"d12-consumers\"><section class=\"d12-panel\"><code>setcc</code><strong>写一个字节</strong><span>结果为 0 或 1</span></section><section class=\"d12-panel\"><code>jcc</code><strong>选择执行路径</strong><span>条件成立时跳到标签</span></section><section class=\"d12-panel\"><code>cmovcc</code><strong>有条件地复制值</strong><span>不跳到另一段代码</span></section></div><figcaption class=\"d12-caption\">先看最近一条修改标志的指令，再解释条件。setcc、jcc、cmovcc 使用这些标志，但不会重新设置这四个标志。</figcaption></figure>"
  }
